group features/cli
note step-note <name> <index> <note>: replace one step's note. The agent needs it because one function can be a step in several tours with a different role in each, which no code comment can say (commit 80cd0f0063f0). The index is the one tours prints in square brackets. A step note says what that step does for this tour; the same function can be a step in several tours with a different note in each.

